@startuml
title CMS 堆布局：ParNew 年轻代 + CMS 老年代
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor white
left to right direction

rectangle "GC Roots" as R #LightYellow
rectangle "年轻代 Young Gen（ParNew 负责）" as YG #LightBlue {
  rectangle "Eden\nbump-pointer 分配" as E
  rectangle "Survivor S0" as S0
  rectangle "Survivor S1" as S1
}
rectangle "老年代 Old Gen（CMS 负责）" as OG #LightGreen {
  rectangle "已分配对象" as O1
  rectangle "free chunk\n（空闲列表）" as FL
}
rectangle "卡表 Card Table\n每 512B 对应 1 字节" as CT #LightYellow

R --> E : 根
R --> O1 : 根
E --> S0 : Minor GC 复制
S0 --> S1 : 再复制
S0 --> O1 : 晋升 promotion
O1 --> E : 跨代引用（脏卡记录）
CT --> OG : 脏卡 -> 记忆集 / 增量更新
note bottom of OG
  老年代分配自 free list；CMS 不移动对象
  晋升抬高占用率 -> 触发 CMS 周期
end note
@enduml
